                <div className="bg-[#151722] p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#2b3044]/40">
                  <h4 className="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Movement 2: The Opening</h4>
                  <p className="text-[11px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Observation and quiet reconnection. Stepping outdoors into gravel and warm grass.</p>
                </div>
                <div className="bg-[#151722] p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#2b3044]/40">
                  <h4 className="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Movement 3: After the Instruments Fell Silent</h4>
                  <p className="text-[11px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Acceptance and stillness under an open sky. Giving up the need to measure altogether.</p>
                </div>
