            {/* System Status Panel (Overlay Right) - Transformed into a ceremonial archive card with delay fade-in */}
            <div className={`absolute right-4 top-4 p-3 bg-slate-950/85 border rounded backdrop-blur-md text-[9px] text-slate-400 space-y-2.5 z-10 w-44 transition-all duration-[1000ms] ${
