          "Green leaves turning upwards to the air.",
          "No more hiding what the heart is feeling,",
          "Joy is waiting, growing everywhere."
        ],
        v3: [
          "Step by step the path is growing clearer,",
          "Where we walked in mist, the light remains.",
          "Every dream we love is drawing nearer,",
          "Washed away are yesterday's dark rains."
        ],
        v4: [
          "Stand together where the wild flowers cover,",
          "Every corner of this sacred space.",
          "Beauty that no winter storm could smother,",
          "Shinning brightly with a quiet grace."
        ],
        outro: [
